flowchart TB
  A["Add environment URL<br/>e.g. https://contoso.crm.dynamics.com"] --> B["Anonymous probe → 401 challenge<br/>reveals the owning tenant"]
  B --> C["MSAL sign-in in the system browser<br/>against that tenant (shared multi-tenant public client)"]
  C --> D{"First time in<br/>this tenant?"}
  D -- yes --> E["Consent: 'Access Dynamics 365 as you'<br/>(admin can consent for the whole org)"]
  D -- no --> F["Silent token from encrypted cache (DPAPI)"]
  E --> G["Delegated token: the tool sees only<br/>what the signed-in admin can see"]
  F --> G
  G --> H["Read-only reader:<br/>GET only · allow-listed functions · 4 concurrent calls · honours 429 Retry-After"]
